(*---
description: Checks enabled on the dead_end machine under unfair fairness.
ref: tlc2/tool/liveness/LiveCheck.java; tlc2/tool/liveness/Liveness.java
features:
  - liveness
outcome: any
config: |
  SPECIFICATION Spec
  PROPERTY Prop
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
---*)
---- MODULE live_dead_end__unfair__enabled ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == x = 0 /\ x' = 1
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x
Prop == [](ENABLED Next => x < 3)
====

